# $(ModName)

A BepInEx 6 Mono plugin scaffolded by GMF for author $(Author).

- Game folder: `$(GameDir)`
- Managed assemblies: `$(ManagedDir)`
- Loader folder: `$(LoaderDir)`
- Deploy folder: `$(ModDeployDir)`

Build with `gmf run unity.build --input modDir=...` and deploy with
`gmf run unity.deploy --input modDir=... --input gameDir=$(GameDir)`.
